OL,3,GNEWSACongleton celebrates return of
OL,4,ASunday rail service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town is celebrating the return of
OL,7,Ftrain services on Sundays following a
OL,8,Fcampaign by local residents.
OL,10,F"We desperately, desperately, need a
OL,11,Fseven day train service, so this is
OL,12,Fgreat news," said Congleton mayor Suzy
OL,13,FFirkin.
OL,15,FNorthern Trains announced earlier this
OL,16,Fweek it had reached an agreement with
OL,17,Fconductors and the RMT Union to pave
OL,18,Fthe way for more Sunday services across
OL,19,Fthe north-west of England.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
