OL,3,GNEWSACongleton celebrates return of
OL,4,ASunday rail service
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom this weekend, five trains in each
OL,7,Fdirection will be reinstated on the
OL,8,FManchester-to-Stoke line, stopping at
OL,9,Fthe Cheshire town on a Sunday for the
OL,10,Ffirst time in two years.
